{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-03/1065311/block/singleImage/3275849/df/01KN1PJ2168PR1DH95CXA72KPF.jpg?updatedAt=1795443370\"/><figcaption>長江生命科技網頁</figcaption></figure><p>長江生命科技(0775)今日(23日)發表公告指，該公司持有約75.2%間接股份權益之Dogwood Therapeutics, Inc.(美：DWTX)宣布，其用於治療化療引起神經疼痛（CINP）的藥物Halneuron，第2b期臨床試驗，取得正面初步結果。 該項試驗達到預期目標。與安慰劑組別比較，於第四周時，每周平均痛楚強度對比基線水平至少減少50%的患者比例，具重大臨床意義之療效。 值得注意的是，無論Halneuron被單獨使用，或與其他已獲批准的慢性痛楚藥物聯合使用，均可觀察到痛楚程度有所減輕。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T15:56:49.560782+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":263,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T14:16:10+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T01:17:08.741730+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T15:50:13.533186+00:00","content_hash":"80563995fe94cf526e5456c66de6b6706c5802ed364b11971b401871f58280fb","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}